. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BnZX6K9XpNMQ7kNvwEC_l3y&_nc_oc=Adqt3DvYk0DIz_LtJQH-o69hEXDGWFqSVlJRdAYK4TWx9AiyrIaGpPPoKB5hlmaMr1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8hg9yOMQvVG2TXlD7uyWAb5rU1ZSibVYUYumeT0HC86A&oe=6A329ABE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ysZO28EjWXQQ7kNvwE1k2SC&_nc_oc=AdooahUQmRgwSARevyrhtknwcJq5w1RWluuP5eOCmsbf7PHZ1aYaH1PrUOsxSZimCz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-8p5SbMPESwKsGp4SQ2dONMOQFDrKk_GP5Mgin0N0l_g&oe=6A32B15E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X38jctfmRzYQ7kNvwFa0T-k&_nc_oc=AdoK7EUjlGaD6OXQ9-He7tTv-F_zFGJqubSbhRCLzJmtOnO8rozQTh8yyXc4XPYhmTk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8dusUvZmhzJt22lfHM-z4lYa09xMxHDXq6M8Fdh3RMTA&oe=6A32A6DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco